   "version": "Introduced in House",
   "date": "2019-11-15",
   "text": "Ban Corporate PACs Act \n This bill prohibits for-profit corporations from establishing a separate segregated political fund. Existing funds must terminate and disburse their entire balance not later than one year after the enactment of this bill."
